Lambda Function
---------------
- Its called single line function.(You can finish the function within same line).
- If you want to write small small function so we use lambda function.
def
---
-  Lambda functions are also called as anonymous functions or Name less functions.
-- Lambda functions are declared by using lambda keyword.

Example
-------
def sum(a,b):
    sum=a+b
    return sum

print(sum(10,20))

#USING LAMBDA FUNCTION
res=lambda a,b:a+b
print(res(10,20))

